ontend/src/components/ChatArea.tsx) is unchanged in the diff, and the implementation in fact honors the no-growth direction by keeping the new focus logic inside CitationModal instead of ChatArea.","Preserved behavior pinned by the contract is intact: the document-keydown Escape handler (CitationModal.tsx:59-65), backdrop and close-button close paths, iframe embed URL with start/autoplay, the 'Open on YouTube' link, pre-wrap transcript rendering, Video-unavailable states and the body-scroll lock are unchanged; the Close button still renders unconditionally in every modal state, keeping it a valid always-present focus target, and no focus trap or inert/aria-hidden on background content was added.","Convergence improves: accessible keyboard behavior is added behind an unchanged interface (a deeper module), no declared no-growth hotspot grows, no new import edges or dependencies appear, and nothing forecloses a deliberate shared focus seam if additional modals ever justify one.","The new test files follow existing conventions (CitationModal.focus.test.tsx alongside CitationModal.test.tsx in components/, ChatArea-citation-focus.test.tsx alongside the existing __tests__/ChatArea-*.test.tsx suites) and exercise only public behavior (render/unmount, document.activeElement), consistent with the deep-module principle; tests sit outside the layer graph's production import constraints and add no production edges."],"verdict":"conform","version":"1.0"},"architecture_builder_sha256":"31ed04c8d4479d7dfb3ac473fb9d1550f79c4ef3befde31b9814fa23492ca038","architecture_guard":{"artifact":"/home/runner/work/_temp/dark-factory/runs/rehead-211-13541c8a5f03/artifacts/final-green-proof.architecture.json","new_cycles":0,"new_forbidden_edges":0,"no_growth_regressions":0,"sha256":"00245a22c4a1264d84014171bf28ca87be0ca176c46397ce85e6fee2b40e0747","unplanned_product_files":0},"change_impact":{"artifact":"/home/runner/work/_temp/dark-factory/runs/rehead-211-13541c8a5f03/artifacts/final-green-proo